select 'inequality-demographics', 'Cultural capital: Types', 'There are three types of cultural capital: embodied capital, objectified capital, and institutionalized capital.', 'Wikipedia: Cultural capital', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Cultural_capital&oldid=1372583246', 'CC BY-SA 4.0. Wikipedia contributors (see page history). Excerpted and split into passages.'
